{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2017/05/18/8380959/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2017/05/18/8380959/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日22：54～ フジテレビ系にて放送の\n『Myfirstbaito』見てください～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、髪を少し切りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2017/05/18/8380959/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんから、虹がふたつ掛かってるのが\n見えたよ！って写真が送られてきた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2017/05/18/8380959/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい！こんな現象が起こるんだ～\nなんだか幸せな予感です( *ˆ﹀ˆ* )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5/14"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜の皆さん有難うございました\n隣の会場で大好きなLUPICIAの\nグランマルシェがやってた！\nずっと行きたかったやつ～\nちくしょう～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか行けたらいいなあ⸜(* ॑▿ ॑* )⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ 私服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2017/05/18/8380959/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、わたし、視力が非常に悪く\n仕事以外は殆ど眼鏡で生活しているのですが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、耳にかけるとこのネジ？が\nゆるくなってきてしまい、下を向くと\n眼鏡が落っこちてしまうようになりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とはいえ、眼鏡屋さんにいちいち直しに\n行くのも面倒なので、まーいーや！\nってな感じで放置したまま、最終的には\n常に上向いて生きていく、という\nエクセレントな手段で生活をしています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一見かっこよく言ってみましたが\nこの手法、非常に間抜けです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という訳で、もっと面倒くさくなって\n最早、眼鏡を掛けずに生活してみるという\n大胆な賭けに出たところ、\n何も見えなくてゴミ箱にゴミと間違えて\n眼鏡が捨ててありました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなことしているうちに、\n舞台『あさひなぐ』はいよいよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明後日、初日です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はGP！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山楽しもうと思います\\ ♪♪ /"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観に来てくださる皆さん宜しくね( ･ᴗ･ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2017/05/18/8380959/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リーくん、猫みたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆ"}],"source":"archive"}